      "writtenOn": "2025-11-08T03:32:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If this must be done before `PWR_EC_PCH_RSMRST` is asserted, I would say this is the right place. \n\nSudden power down sequence (for instance `apshutdown`) calls `board_ap_power_action_g3_entry` as a consequence of the power signals `board_ap_power_force_shutdown` has modified.\n\nIf we want to ensure power signals order, we should keep them in a single function, later power sequence will move to proper state based on power signals values.",
      "parentUuid": "3a05a898_8fc558b5",
